0], \"page_id\": 79}], \"content\": \"The monthly Treasury Survey of Ownership covers securities issued by the United States Government, Federal agencies, Federally-sponsored agencies, and the District of Columbia. The banks and insurance companies included in the Survey currently account for about 80 percent of all such securities held by these institutions. The similar proportion for corporations and for savings and loan associations is 50 percent, and for State and local governments, 40 percent. Data were first published for banks and insurance companies in the May 1941 Treasury Bulletin, for corporations and savings and loan associa-\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [951, 404, 1594, 471], \"page_id\": 79}], \"content\": \"tions in the September 1960 Bulletin, and for State and local governments in the February 1962 Bulletin.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [951, 563, 1598, 730], \"page_id\": 79}], \"content\": \"Holdings by commercial banks distributed according to Federal Reserve member bank classes and nonmember banks are published for June 30 and December 31. Holdings by corporate pension trust funds are published quarterly, first appearing in the March 1954 Bulletin.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [657, 969, 1230, 1018], \"page_id\": 79}], \"content\": \"Table TSO-1-Summary of Federal Securities\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [749, 1047, 1080, 1083], \"page_id\": 79}], \"content\": \"(Par values - in millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [235, 1083, 1606, 1743], \"page_id\": 79}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">Classification</th><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">Total amount outstanding 1/</th><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">U.S. Government accounts and Federal Reserve banks</th><th rowspan=