17], \"page_id\": 93}], \"content\": \"Table IFS-4 shows United States Treasury nonmarketable bonds and notes issued to official institutions of foreign countries.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [935, 414, 1641, 471], \"page_id\": 93}], \"content\": \"Table IFS-5 sets forth the factors which affect the United States position in the International Monetary Fund.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [935, 473, 1643, 553], \"page_id\": 93}], \"content\": \"Table IFS-6 presents a measure of weighted-average changes in exchange rates between the United States dollar and the currencies of certain other countries.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [687, 594, 1123, 638], \"page_id\": 93}], \"content\": \"Table IFS-1. - U.S. Reserve Assets\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [753, 669, 1011, 694], \"page_id\": 93}], \"content\": \"(In millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [178, 694, 1647, 1373], \"page_id\": 93}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>End of calendar year or month</th><th>Total reserve assets 1/(1)</th><th colspan=\\\"2\\\">Gold stock 2/</th><th>Special drawing rights 1/ 4/(4)</th><th>Foreign currencies 5/(5)</th><th>Reserve position in International Monetary Fund 1/ 6/(6)</th></tr><tr><th></th><th></th><th>Total 3/(2)</th><th>Treasury (3)</th><th></th><th></th><th></th></tr><tr><td>1969</td><td>16,964 7/</td><td>11,859</td><td>10,367</td><td>-</td><td>2,781 7/</td><td>2,324</td></tr><tr><td>1970</td><td>14,487</td><td>11,072</td><td>10,732</td><td>851</td><td>629</td><td>1,935</td></tr><tr><td>1971</td><td>12,167 8/</td><td>10,206</td><td>10,132</td><td>1,100</td><td>276 8/</td><td>585</td></tr><tr><td>1972</td><td>13,151 9/</td><td>10,487 9/</td><td>10,410 9/</td><td>1,958 9/</td><td>241</td><td>465 9/