sets (plant and equipment) and capitalized leases for plant and equipment.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [243, 730, 835, 800], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"2/ Foreign branches and majority-owned partnerships and subsidiaries only.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [235, 813, 835, 931], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"3/ Weekly worldwide net positions of banks and banking institutions in the United States, and their foreign branches and majority-owned foreign subsidiaries. Excludes capital assets and liabilities.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [245, 941, 824, 985], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"4/ Foreign branches and majority-owned subsidiaries only.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [252, 1000, 831, 1119], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"5/ Monthly worldwide net positions including capital assets and liabilities on the last business day of the month of banks and banking institutions in the United States and their foreign branches and majority-owned subsidiaries.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [245, 1139, 822, 1175], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"6/ Foreign branches and majority-owned subsidiaries only.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [250, 1201, 473, 1239], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"SECTIONS II THROUGH X\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [256, 1273, 851, 1427], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"Positions of nonbanking business concerns in the United States and their foreign branches and majority-owned partnerships and subsidiaries. In section X, positions of foreign branches and majority-owned partnerships and subsidiaries only.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [239, 1443, 837, 1669], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"2/ Includes unsettled spot foreign exchange purchase contracts, as well as currency, demand and time deposits, negotiable and other readily transferable financial instruments maturing in one year or less from the report date, and intracompany claims and loans to other parties repayable on demand. Other loans, accounts receivable, and unaccepted trade drafts are excluded.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [243, 1679, 841, 1859], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"3/ Includes unsettled spot foreign exchange sales contracts, intracompany liabilities, other than short-term trade payables, short-term borrowings due in one year or less from the report date, and the current portion of long-term debt. Other loans, accrued expenses and accounts payable are excluded.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [243, 1869, 849, 1967], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"Due in one year or less; includes intracompany trade receivables. Receivables and installment paper sold or discounted before maturity are excluded.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [243, 1967, 857, 2047], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"5/ Due in one year or less; includes intracompany trade payables.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 16, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1007, 447, 1616, 684], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"All current assets other than liquid assets and short-term trade receivables, and financial assets maturing in more than one year from the report date. Includes intracompany accounts, inventories, prepayments, long-term trade receivables, long-term intracompany claims, and stocks, bonds, and other securities. Fixed assets (plant and equipment) and parents' investment in majority-owned foreign subsidiaries are excluded.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 17, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1021, 689, 1614, 869], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"7/ All financial liabilities other than short-term debt and short-term trade payables; includes long-term trade payables; intracompany liabilities, accrued expenses, and liabilities maturing in more than one year from the report date. Capitalized plant and equipment leases are excluded.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 18, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1019, 877, 1622, 985], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"8/ Outstanding amounts of foreign exchange which have been contracted to be received or delivered in the future. Excludes spot exchange.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 19, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1019, 990, 1606, 1062], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"9/ Columns (1),(3),(5), and (7) less columns (2),(4),(6), and (8).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 20, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1011, 1070, 1616, 1185], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"10/ Representative rates on the report date. Canadian dollar and United Kingdom pound rates are expressed in U.S. dollars per unit of foreign currency, all others in foreign units per U.S. dollar.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 21, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1009, 1214, 1614, 1340], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"11/ Banks and banking institutions in the United States and their foreign branches and majority-owned subsidiaries. In section X, foreign branches and majority-owned subsidiaries only.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 22, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1025, 1347, 1463, 1383], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"12/ Excludes capital assets and liabilities.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 23, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1033, 1386, 1555, 1435], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"13/ Includes both spot and forward exchange contracts.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 24, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1033, 1437, 1342, 1481], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"14/ Sum of columns (3) and (8).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 25, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1025, 1484, 1352, 1522], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"15/ Sum of columns (4) and (9).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 26, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1015, 1525, 1354, 1563], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"16/ Sum of columns (5) and (10).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 27, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1027, 1569, 1238, 1607], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"17/ See footnote 10.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 28, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1027, 1612, 1244, 1648], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"18/ See footnote 11.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 29, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1027, 1653, 1630, 1782], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"19/ Fixed-rate loans are reported by time remaining to final maturity or the nearest call date, whichever is earlier, and floating-rate loans by time remaining to the nearest interest-fixing date.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 30, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1031, 1785, 1606, 1857], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"20/ Option forward exchange contracts are reported by time remaining to the nearest option exercise date.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 31, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1015, 1857, 1346, 1900], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"21/ Sum of columns (3) and (6).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 32, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1015, 1898, 1227, 1967], \"page_id\": 146}], \"content\": \"r Revised. n.a. Not available.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 33, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [194, 93, 475, 147], \"page_id\": 147}], \"content\": \"February 1980\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1557, 116, 1630, 1